  s0: Question arrives
  s1: Refused
  s2: The question is read
  s3: The book is searched
  s4: Passages chosen
  s5: Book guard
  s6: The model writes
  s7: Citation gate
  s8: Gloss pass
  s9: Answer shown
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the question tries to inject instructions
  s0 --> s2: the reader asks
  s2 --> s3: the ask is read and searched
  s3 --> s1: no passage matches
  s3 --> s4: the passages are fused into a window
  s4 --> s5: the question's words are in the book
  s5 --> s1: the question names something the book never mentions
  s5 --> s6: the passages go to the model
  s6 --> s7: the model writes a body
  s7 --> s6: the body is uncited, so one retry with a citation prefill
  s7 --> s8: a verbatim sentence from a shown passage is recovered or the citation checks out
  s7 --> s1: nothing shown can back the body
  s8 --> s9: the gloss is written
